<title>USA: GRC looking to sell Advanced Products unit.</title>
<headline>GRC looking to sell Advanced Products unit.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRC International said on Thursday it would seek to sell the businesses comprising its Advanced Products Division to help it reduce expenses and return to profitability.</p>
<p>GRC said Smith Barney continues to advise it on a full range of financial and strategic options.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
